---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero';

/*
 * This page previously sold "AZAP Pass" (₦3,500/mo for 20% off) and "AZAP Plus"
 * (₦6,500/mo for 30% off), both with a live "Request Access" button.
 *
 * Neither could be delivered. AZAP does not set the job price — the pro and the
 * customer agree it directly — so there is no price to discount, and at ₦1,000
 * of revenue per job there is no margin to absorb one either. Selling a discount
 * on someone else's price is not a plan, it is a liability.
 *
 * What replaces it is the actual model: free for customers, one flat fee for
 * pros. See BRIDGE_MODEL.md in the main repo.
 */
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing"
  description="Free for customers. AZAP takes no commission on any job. Pros keep 100% of what they charge."
>
  <PageHero
    client:load
    title="Free to book."
    subtitle="You pay AZAP nothing. Your pro keeps everything they charge. Here is exactly how we make money instead."
  />

  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 px-6">
    <div class="container-tight !px-0">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">

        <div class="card-enterprise p-10 md:p-12 flex flex-col">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 mb-8 block">If you're booking</span>
          <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold mb-3 tracking-tight"><span class="mr-1">₦</span>0</div>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 font-medium mb-10">No catch, and nothing to sign up for.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-600 font-medium text-sm mb-10">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-ink rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> No booking fee, no service fee, no subscription</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-ink rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Nothing is added to the price your pro quotes you</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-ink rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> You agree the price directly and pay your pro directly</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-ink rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> A real person calls to confirm before anyone is sent</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/book" class="btn-capsule bg-ink text-white border-transparent hover:bg-zinc-800 w-full py-4 mt-auto">Book a pro</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-ink text-white p-10 md:p-12 rounded-3xl flex flex-col shadow-2xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500 mb-8 block">If you're a pro</span>
          <div class="text-6xl font-extrabold mb-3 tracking-tight"><span class="mr-1">₦</span>1,000</div>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mb-3">Per job you accept and finish. That's the whole fee.</p>
          <p class="text-accent font-bold text-sm mb-10">Free for every job during our launch month.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-400 font-medium text-sm mb-10">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-white rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> <span><strong class="text-white">No commission.</strong> You keep 100% of what you charge</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-white rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Nothing to pay when we send you no work</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-white rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> No monthly fee and no signup cost</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-white rounded-full mt-2 shrink-0"></span> You set your own prices, every time</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/provider" class="btn-capsule bg-white text-ink border-transparent hover:bg-zinc-100 w-full py-4 mt-auto">See the terms for pros</a>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-10 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-5">Why we don't take a percentage</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 font-medium leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Most platforms take a cut of what the worker earns, often 10% to 30%. The trouble
          is that the cut ends up in your price: a pro who loses 20% simply quotes 20% more,
          and booking through the platform costs you more than calling that person directly.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          So we charge a flat ₦1,000 for finding the work, and we take nothing from the job
          itself. Your pro is paid exactly what they quoted you, whether that's ₦4,000 or
          ₦400,000, and they have no reason to inflate it to cover us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
